["Stand the third-floor pillars","On the inner plank ring of the balcony, the one 9 blocks across, stand the pillars again, in the same pattern as the floor below: 12 pillars of cherry log, each 5 tall (layers 15–19). A corner pillar, one empty block, a pillar, three empty blocks, a pillar, one empty block, and the other corner. That is 60 logs.",[]],
